      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "It is a natural and painful reaction to see our parents struggle and to feel the weight of their sacrifice, but trying to live up to that self-sacrifice and ignoring the pain you feel to \"endure\" it could end up hurting you in the long term.\n\nI encourage you to explore safe messages to your dad directly, as letting it all in and out can help you start the painful but necessary self-healing process you need to take.\n\nPlease consider seeking help from a therapist or counselor who can provide the support you need to work through these feelings without isolation.",
      "source": "target",
