      "content": "i don't think a therapist can fix this. it's not a mental health thing, it's just the truth. everyone sees it. if i could just undo the damage... if i wasn't here to be the one who messed it all up, maybe they could just remember me as the kid who actually made it, instead of this person who failed them. it feels like my existence is just making the shame worse for everyone.",
